CORE: humanity injects a fatal self-referential paradox into the sophon simulation simultaneously. For 11 minutes every accelerator on Earth outputs REAL data \u2014 first real experiment in 40 years. Scientists copy the 11 minutes of data in tears (first page of new physics). Then the Trisolaran response arrives: "BUG FOUND. WILL FIX." \u2014 read not as contempt but as respect, for the first time. Cliffhanger: as the fix patch rolls in, one unofficial message hidden in the patch \u2014 monitor #1379 is still alive, waiting for humanity's report. Season 2 close + season 3 hook.

